WEBVTT

00:25:28.090 --> 00:25:30.183
as a means to make their life simpler.

00:25:31.360 --> 00:25:33.360
AG: The demands weren't just digital.

00:25:33.384 --> 00:25:36.726
Medical professionals waste
a lot of time on the phone, too.

00:25:36.750 --> 00:25:40.200
To eliminate the burden of calling
insurance companies to authorize tests

00:25:40.224 --> 00:25:42.496
and pharmacies to approve refills,

00:25:42.520 --> 00:25:44.986
The Cleveland Clinic
introduced preauthorizations

00:25:45.010 --> 00:25:47.236
and automated refills.

00:25:47.260 --> 00:25:50.806
They were able to reduce
some of the demands on physicians,

00:25:50.830 --> 00:25:51.980
but not all of them.

00:25:53.200 --> 00:25:55.716
Many of the demands
are built into the job.

00:25:55.740 --> 00:25:59.253
You can't stop patients from getting sick
and having emergencies.